@host = http://localhost:5101

### 1. Login da ana (papel "agent"). O "# @name" guarda a resposta na variável "loginAna".
# @name loginAna
POST {{host}}/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "username": "ana", "password": "123" }

### 2. /me com o token da ana -> 200
GET {{host}}/me
Authorization: Bearer {{loginAna.response.body.accessToken}}

### 3. /admin com o token da ana -> 403 (autenticada, mas sem o papel "admin")
GET {{host}}/admin
Authorization: Bearer {{loginAna.response.body.accessToken}}

### 4. Login do bruno (papel "admin")
# @name loginBruno
POST {{host}}/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "username": "bruno", "password": "123" }

### 5. /admin com o token do bruno -> 200
GET {{host}}/admin
Authorization: Bearer {{loginBruno.response.body.accessToken}}

### 6. /me sem token -> 401
GET {{host}}/me
